## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical implementation of per-tenant isolation in a shared GCP project, focusing on real-world controls rather than theory.

## Key Concepts
- IAM Conditions and least-privilege service accounts
- VPC Service Controls and Private Service Connect
- Customer-managed encryption keys (CMEK)
- CI/CD gates with synthetic tenants and rollback safety
- Data Loss Prevention (DLP) and ongoing IAM reviews

## Code Example
